fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"frei0r/frei0r-filter-kaleid0sc0pe.html#frei0r-filter-kaleid0sc0pe:reflect-edges","fragment":"\n\treflect-edges\n\nif true then reflections that end up outside the source reflect back into it, otherwise the specified background colour is used.\n\n\tFlags :\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\tRead\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t/\t\t\n\t\t\t\tWrite\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\tDefault value :\tfalse\n\n"});